---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import theme from '../../theme.config.js';
const siteName = theme.site.name;
const lastUpdated = 'October 23, 2026';
---
<Base
  title={`AI Use Policy » ${siteName}`}
  description={`My commitment not to use AI to write or create content for ${siteName}.`}
>
  <section class="page">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h1 class="page-title">AI use policy</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: <strong>{lastUpdated}</strong></p>

      <p>
        I have decided not to use AI at all for drafting, writing, creating, or otherwise producing content for this
        blog. The only exception is making changes to the website itself, since I am not a proficient web developer.
      </p>

      <p>
        I have used AI in a few articles so far. Starting Friday, October 23, 2026, I will never use AI for the content
        of this blog.
      </p>

      <p>
        I know this is a strong decision and some people may think it is wrong, but I am willing to stick to it. I do
        not like anything written by AI, even if it has been verified by a human. I believe others may feel the same
        way.
      </p>

      <p>
        The unique value of this website will be that I do not use AI to write its content.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
